# General principles

- **DRY / clarity:** Reuse helpers and types; names reflect intent; prefer explicit behavior.
- **Structure:** Small focused modules; validate at boundaries; handle errors near the source.
- **Quality:** Test behavior; meaningful commits; document public APIs; profile before micro-optimizing.

